{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Easy Notes 是一款專注於純文字記錄的筆記 App，適合需要簡單、輕量且可離線使用的 iPhone、iPad、Mac 及 Apple Watch 用戶。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-210.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>純文字筆記簡單直接</h2>\n<p>Easy Notes 只保留純文字，關閉自動校正與智能引號，讓拼寫依輸入原樣保存；打字時自動儲存，開啟即進入新筆記。它支援資料夾與子資料夾、跨筆記搜尋、字數與字元統計，亦可批次移動或刪除筆記。筆記可離線使用並提供逐篇加密，另可選用 iCloud 同步至 iPhone、iPad、Mac 與 Apple Watch，或匯入文字檔及匯出 .txt。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-203-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-204-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-205-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-206-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-207-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-208-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Easy Notes: Plain Text Editor</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/easy-notes-plain-text-editor/id6826717180?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:53:22.595354+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:41:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:39.962150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:51.971527+00:00","content_hash":"94906cd414c7ff0a6d2cbcbb753754892d91a9690dcfb9279594fd3b1bcb8046","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}